{"audio": "colossians-04.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 124533, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2133, "text": "Colossians, Chapter Four."}, {"start_ms": 2133, "end_ms": 8800, "text": "Masters, give unto your servants that which is just and equal; knowing that ye also have a Master in heaven."}, {"start_ms": 8800, "end_ms": 24800, "text": "Continue in prayer, and watch in the same with thanksgiving; Withal praying also for us, that God would open unto us a door of utterance, to speak the mystery of Christ, for which I am also in bonds: That I may make it manifest, as I ought to speak."}, {"start_ms": 24800, "end_ms": 29200, "text": "Walk in wisdom toward them that are without, redeeming the time."}, {"start_ms": 29200, "end_ms": 36400, "text": "Let your speech be alway with grace, seasoned with salt, that ye may know how ye ought to answer every man."}, {"start_ms": 36400, "end_ms": 54267, "text": "All my state shall Tychicus declare unto you, who is a beloved brother, and a faithful minister and fellowservant in the Lord: Whom I have sent unto you for the same purpose, that he might know your estate, and comfort your hearts; With Onesimus, a faithful and beloved brother, who is one of you."}, {"start_ms": 54267, "end_ms": 57867, "text": "They shall make known unto you all things which are done here."}, {"start_ms": 57867, "end_ms": 71600, "text": "Aristarchus my fellowprisoner saluteth you, and Marcus, sister's son to Barnabas, (touching whom ye received commandments: if he come unto you, receive him;) And Jesus, which is called Justus, who are of the circumcision."}, {"start_ms": 71600, "end_ms": 76667, "text": "These only are my fellowworkers unto the kingdom of God, which have been a comfort unto me."}, {"start_ms": 76667, "end_ms": 87467, "text": "Epaphras, who is one of you, a servant of Christ, saluteth you, always labouring fervently for you in prayers, that ye may stand perfect and complete in all the will of God."}, {"start_ms": 87467, "end_ms": 94133, "text": "For I bear him record, that he hath a great zeal for you, and them that are in Laodicea, and them in Hierapolis."}, {"start_ms": 94133, "end_ms": 97467, "text": "Luke, the beloved physician, and Demas, greet you."}, {"start_ms": 97467, "end_ms": 102933, "text": "Salute the brethren which are in Laodicea, and Nymphas, and the church which is in his house."}, {"start_ms": 102933, "end_ms": 112000, "text": "And when this epistle is read among you, cause that it be read also in the church of the Laodiceans; and that ye likewise read the epistle from Laodicea."}, {"start_ms": 112000, "end_ms": 117733, "text": "And say to Archippus, Take heed to the ministry which thou hast received in the Lord, that thou fulfil it."}, {"start_ms": 117733, "end_ms": 120800, "text": "The salutation by the hand of me Paul."}, {"start_ms": 120800, "end_ms": 122000, "text": "Remember my bonds."}, {"start_ms": 122000, "end_ms": 123600, "text": "Grace be with you."}, {"start_ms": 123600, "end_ms": 124533, "text": "Amen."}], "words": [{"t": "Colossians,", "s": 382, "e": 1046, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1328, "e": 1670, "si": 0}, {"t": "Four.", "s": 1751, "e": 1992, "si": 0}, {"t": "Masters,", "s": 2313, "e": 2774, "si": 1}, {"t": "give", "s": 2994, "e": 3134, "si": 1}, {"t": "unto", "s": 3174, "e": 3294, "si": 1}, {"t": "your", "s": 3334, "e": 3454, "si": 1}, {"t": "servants", "s": 3534, "e": 3915, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 3955, "e": 4135, "si": 1}, {"t": "which", "s": 4155, "e": 4315, "si": 1}, {"t": "is", "s": 4355, "e": 4455, "si": 1}, {"t": "just", "s": 4536, "e": 4856, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 4976, "e": 5076, "si": 1}, {"t": "equal;", "s": 5156, "e": 5456, "si": 1}, {"t": "knowing", "s": 6317, "e": 6658, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 6698, "e": 6838, "si": 1}, {"t": "ye", "s": 6878, "e": 6958, "si": 1}, {"t": "also", "s": 7178, "e": 7439, "si": 1}, {"t": "have", "s": 7579, "e": 7719, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 7739, "e": 7759, "si": 1}, {"t": "Master", "s": 